:: Carter Hang Out End Late High Fun [nobr]

/* Intro */
<span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> is regaling you with a tale of daring do and one of his recent adventurers in do-gooding, when he suddenly trips over his own feet and tumbles forward! Thankfully, you manage to catch him just in time and pull him back to his feel. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Haha, whoops. Thanks for the save!”</span> He laughs with a tinge of redness in his cheeks. As he steadies himself, he suddenly catches a glimpse at the sky and you notice a face of realization appears.<br>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
        Name: "Player",
        State: {
            Mouth: "Smirk",
            },
        },
        {
        Name: "Carter",
        State: {
            Outfit: $HangOutClothes,
            Mouth: "Happy",
            Blush: 1,
            },
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Darn it, it’s already sundown?”</span> He says in a surprised voice, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Dang, I need to get heading home! If I’m out too late, I’ll get in trouble. I’ll see you later!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> quickly begins to grab his things and prepares to head off.<br>
<br>

<div id="choice">
	<<link "Spinning hug goodbye<br>">>
    <<replace"#choice">>
        You grab <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> once more from behind, lifting him up off the ground into a spinning hug. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Wow! Ahaha, what are you doing?”</span> He laughs as you release him and he stumbles around dizzy. You explain that it was a hug goodbye and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> grabs onto your arms to stop himself from falling. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Oh, haha, okay. Goodbye!”</span> <span style="color:LightGreen"> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> tries to walk off, though he is clearly a little dizzy and almost ends up falling quite a few times. It’s funny to watch.</span> <br>
        <br>
        [[Continue|Park]]
    <</replace>>
    <</link>>
	<<link "Try not to fall into any trashcans on the way home!<br>">>
    <<replace"#choice">>
        As <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> hurries off, you do a quick check to ensure his shoes are tied and there isn’t any stray object or animal in the way. Thankfully, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> is safe and able to run off without immediately tripping. You wave goodbye and tell him to try not to slip down any hills or fall into a trashcan on his way home.<br>
        <br>
        <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Haha! Very funny!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> calls back… before nearly immediately falling into a nearby wastebin. <span style="color:Pink">He blushes and continues running off without looking back, praying you didn’t see that. You did.</span> <br>
        <br>
        [[Continue|Park]]
    <</replace>>
    <</link>>
</div>